  "pseudocode": "1. function buildBST(arr, left, right) {\n2.   if (left > right) return null;\n3.   mid = Math.floor((left + right) / 2);\n4.   node = new Node(arr[mid]);\n5.   node.left = buildBST(arr, left, mid - 1);\n6.   node.right = buildBST(arr, mid + 1, right);\n7.   return node;\n8. }",
